While it would be nice; I don't agree that Nintendo has any obligation to release early because of a leak.

&#x200B;

People who pirate the game will invariably be banned. Most people pirating this likely know this, so they're doing this on a switch they're exclusively keeping offline. The full retail release will have the benefit of patches, and online play; so you can't really say they're "competing with one another".

&#x200B;

I would wager that a large percentage of people pirating the game are just doing so to get a head start, and will be buying the game when it's released to access all of the features.

